eight\":0.016190597211110824},{\"text\":\"number of displays. But it was deliberate-\",\"x\":0.494758928330305,\"y\":0.4097719867059385,\"width\":0.3773584661905427,\"height\":0.013355048859934882},{\"text\":\"ly intended to be so, for it made the day\",\"x\":0.49266247969298876,\"y\":0.3938110750630519,\"width\":0.37735846619054275,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"a more memorable one！\",\"x\":0.4947589197523144,\"y\":0.38078175896613553,\"width\":0.21174002904883,\"height\":0.011726384364820874},{\"text\":\"May the Student Council thank Rev.\",\"x\":0.5366876362293175,\"y\":0.35602605880868077,\"width\":0.33333331419405576,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"Fr. Deignan and the teachers for their in-\",\"x\":0.4905660432544451,\"y\":0.34156976730395183,\"width\":0.37945490610117294,\"height\":0.01453488377872425},{\"text\":\"valuable advice and assistance during the\",\"x\":0.4947589145391284,\"y\":0.32703488344978515,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.014658927917480469},{\"text\":\"preparation, especially Miss Ho who most\",\"x\":0.49475890553769186,\"y\":0.31237784995228346,\"width\":0.37735849489945905,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"graciously accepted the post of adviser to\",\"x\":0.49475891336512434,\"y\":0.29934853415895424,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.014657980456026065},{\"text\":\"the committee. May the Student Council\",\"x\":0.49475891336512434,\"y\":0.28631921828490603,\"width\":0.3752620549888288,\"height\":0.011726384364820874},{\"text\":\"also extend its gratitude to the staff of the\",\"x\":0.4947589127396876,\"y\":0.27166123748436544,\"width\":0.37526205498882875,\"height\":0.013355048859934882},{\"text\":\"school and the volunteers for the Open Day\",\"x\":0.49056605274081805,\"y\":0.25436046538751256,\"width\":0.379454906101173,\"height\":0.01599784068253607},{\"text\":\"Committee. Special thanks are expressed\",\"x\":0.4947589140499599,\"y\":0.24127906949629663,\"width\":0.37526205498882